  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Nigeria&apos;s UK Health System Strengthening Programme for FCDO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This thematic evaluation seeks to examine the effectiveness of 20 years of BHC Nigeria health system strengthening (HSS) programming in Nigeria &#x2013; and learn lessons around the interconnectedness between interventions, long term impact and sustainability. It will also study the key linkages between the health system strengthening portfolio and other parts of the BHC Nigeria portfolio (such as the governance portfolio) and assess what contributions these made to results, impact and sustainability. It will provide evidence to guide BHC Nigeria&#x2019;s future health systems strengthening investments, inform the Nigerian government&#x2019;s new health reform agenda, and contribute to filling global evidence gaps on the effectiveness and sustainability of health system strengthening interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
